{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108182","id":2634039103,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6dAD8_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108182","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108182.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108182.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108182","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108182/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108182/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108182/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/227ef6773f2897cd3b71f625d2f80bca6caa79f8","number":108182,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: More reliably detect cyclic inheritance in script classes","user":{"login":"squk","id":3443591,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDM1OTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3443591?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk","html_url":"https://github.com/squk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/squk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is my first contribution :) Trying to debug why the editor doesn't display properties for some script base classes and I managed to get this change working. \r\n\r\nDifferent GDScript instances can refer to the same logical GDScript, so comparing pointer values is not reliable.\r\n\r\nThis change also includes the inheritance chain as a part of the error message. \r\n\r\n(There seems to be some race at load time. Prior to this change, I only get the error message in ~2/10 editor runs vs 10/10 with a build using these changes)\r\n\r\nError message before this change:\r\n`ERROR: Cyclic inheritance in script class`\r\nAfter:\r\n`ERROR: Cyclic inheritance in script class: SwitchBase -> Entity -> SwitchBase`","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user